{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_vrtx_01T5MD55RqUcrPyenbqVAWrY","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-4-7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me modify the `human_loop_express.md` template. I need to:\n1. Add 第零步 before 第一步\n2. Add 第五步 after 第四步\n\nThe 第零步 should:\n- Read `{{draft_dir}}/human-learning/judgment.md`\n- If file doesn't exist, skip silently\n- Delete entries that are logically confused / self-contradictory / lacking substance\n- Keep entries confirmed explicitly by human (preserve original wording)\n- Don't add new content\n\nThe 第五步 should:\n- Ask 3 questions:\n  ① 难度感受 (difficulty experience — as iteration direction signal)\n  ② 核心收获 (core gain — as original thinking signal, advances ZPD)  \n  ③ 还缺什么 (what's still missing — as capability boundary signal, for next loop ZPD re-evaluation)\n- Write answers structured to `{{draft_dir}}/progress.md` (append this loop's evaluation record)\n- Append suggestions for next iteration to `{{draft_dir}}/loops.md` (following the four-field format from task2)\n\nFor the progress.md format, I'm creating a markdown structure with a Loop 评价 section dated with the current date, followed by the three evaluation responses.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"484eb51e-62a3-42be-b628-65310b0a28c6","uuid":"bc9d4225-dbe4-47c1-bfda-46c508baec3a"}
